{"id":"entscheidung","lemma":"Entscheidung","pos":"noun","rank":639,"glosses":["decision"],"ipa":"/ʔɛntˈʃaɪ̯dʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0e/De-Entscheidung.ogg/De-Entscheidung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Entscheidung","plural":"Entscheidungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Es war meine Entscheidung.","en":"It was my decision.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/391861","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Wer fällt hier die Entscheidungen?","en":"Who makes the decisions here?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich muss eine Entscheidung treffen.","en":"I have a decision to make.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760947","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to meet"}]},{"text":"Es ist eure Entscheidung.","en":"It's your decision.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394123","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"your","l":"euer"},null]},{"text":"Wir treffen alle Entscheidungen zusammen.","en":"We make every decision together.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to meet"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null,{"g":"together"}]}]}